### Third-Party Comparisons
**Source:** BenchLM, Artificial Analysis, My Summit, Kingy, Spheron, Verdent, OpenRouter
**Snapshot:** July-October 2026

Multiple independent sources provide comparative analysis:
- Kimi K3 vs Kimi K2.5: K3 is more intelligent (44 vs 23 on AI Index), but K2.5 is faster (68.3 vs 40.6 tokens/second), cheaper ($0.49 vs $2.31 per 1M tokens), and has lower latency (1.84s vs 3.38s TTFB)
- Kimi K3 vs Kimi K2.6: K3 is 3.5-4x more expensive ($3/$15 vs $0.95/$4), but has 4x larger context (1M vs 256K)
- Kimi K3 vs Kimi K3.1 Pro: K3.1 Pro is 33% cheaper ($2/$10 vs $3/$15)
- Kimi K3 vs Claude Fable 5: K3 trails on GDPval-AA v2 (1,686 vs 1,815 Elo), but leads on coding benchmarks
- Kimi K3 vs GPT-5.6 Sol: K3 trails on Terminal-Bench 2.1 (88.3% vs 88.8%), but leads on SWE Marathon (42.0% vs no verified score found)
- Kimi K3 vs Kimi K2.7 Code: K3 is more capable but 3.5-4x more expensive

