**Important Note:** Kimi K3.1 Pro (released October 2026) offers improved performance and lower pricing:
- Pricing: $2/$10 per 1M tokens (33% cheaper than K3)
- Improved performance on reasoning benchmarks
- Faster speed than K3 (estimated 60+ tokens/second)
- Lower latency than K3 (estimated 2s TTFB)
